<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces killed Lashkar-e-Taiba commander Lateef Bhat during an encounter in Kulgam, where he had taken shelter in a mosque and refused repeated calls to surrender. The operation also resulted in the recovery of a body and weapon, and linked a man who had previously sheltered the commander to the cell. In Manipur, over 1,000 CRPF personnel were redeployed from Chhattisgarh, including the withdrawal of an anti-Naxal battalion, while Maharashtra announced a Rs 1.5 lakh reward for information on looted weapons. The ISI revived a K‑2 plan to coordinate multiple terror groups for attacks in Punjab. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPWU1udWFFaGlWTEo1OUJfUHNpMjBhY19UTVJkNjVNSnFYMVdCVDZPa2FRUk0talg4bm4xbnkzX3FGS1g2b1hhdHZnUFZHQ0N5d1RYOEZxZjUtMjJRd3pxOW9RVjhRMHA4cTRxdXE1cHRpdC1UNUwzTXFHQlRaN2N2bHZtU245NkV6cTNOVXktcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir News Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOVWtuZUp2M2hjWXFkRVZoem5vbF9SMWl5THRwVzlrdE1mWFNEYm43NWEwcl9GaXIzWkt1REU0Vl9ST2ZtMlo1WXdHRndpZF8xaGdYYzcxNjQ2QWhMY2pIS2REYW0tcFdIdkpTSERlSTdLUEFZWkZHZGN2c1BYN0dxeFRyMFQ5SllTbVFEZk12NHhiV2ZXMmhOMF9QN1VNMjFqdlBqM2txWHk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Observer Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.-?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Federal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQOWZza2R4QTV1RHZpSE01MXBBT1BaUkdWV19TVGZaVFVIeVhXSnZJdVBzcTdFU0JsVnk2Z1lZYUd